# Forecast engine

Location: app/server/services/forecast/*

Core modules (selected)
- ForecastEngine — orchestrator for a single run
- DataLoaderService — loads DB state into in-memory/cache structures
- AccountRegisterService — account-level operations and projections
- ReoccurrenceService — schedule generation and amount adjustments
- RegisterEntryService — materializes ledger entries
- LoanCalculatorService — interest and amortization
- TransferService — inter-register transfers with validation and ordering
- DateTime/DateTimeService — date math, weekend adjustments, intervals
- ModernCacheService — optimized in-memory caching
- DataPersisterService — persists snapshots/results back to DB
- getProjectedBalanceAtDate.ts — helper for point-in-time projection

Testing
- Extensive unit/integration/regression tests under app/server/services/forecast/__tests__
- When changing behavior, add regression fixtures/snapshots alongside targeted unit tests

Guidance
- Keep deterministic results under known seeds; avoid relying on wall clock outside DateTimeService
- Rate limits and performance tunings in forecast/lib/rateLimiter.ts — consider when expanding scope
